[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The authoritative source of the fleet plan is outside this repository

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[DECISION]
UID: DEC-SOURCE-OUT-OF-REPO
TITLE: The authoritative source of the fleet plan is outside this repository
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATUS: open
RETIRES_ON: >>>
The corpus is converted to sdoc in this repository, or the operator confirms the
markdown carve-out supersedes the original entirely.
<<<
STATEMENT: >>>
The original plan exists as a published HTML artifact outside this repository.
The markdown under private/strict-doc/design is a carve-out from it, produced to
strip reader-facing duplication and prepare for sdoc conversion. Which of the
two is authoritative where they disagree has not been decided, and the carve-out
is not human signed off.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Recorded as a node so that a conversion session does not silently pick one.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Human acceptance needed. This node points at content this graph cannot validate.
<<<
